title: crosspeak
abstract: >-
  Generalized two-dimensional correlation spectroscopy (2DCOS) for vibrational
  spectra: synchronous and asynchronous maps via the Hilbert-Noda transform,
  heterospectral and moving-window correlation, preprocessing, and plotting.
